; [57]   { Token scratch. Module-level: a String local would take a 256-byte frame
; [58]     block at every call site (Part 24 s5.2), and the tokeniser is called once
; [59]     per input line with a fresh token per word. }
; [60]   ZDWord     : String;
; [61] 
; [62] { ---- Header -------------------------------------------------------------- }
